            "type": "text",
            "text": "Icing cap (partial sphere)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In white yarn, make a magic ring with 6 dc. Increase to 30 dc over five rounds. Work even for two more rounds. Do not close. This "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
